		<title>동탄 리프팅, 고주파 vs 초음파 내 얼굴에 맞는 타입은?</title>
		<link>https://dongtan-snow.com/?p=7211&#038;utm_source=rss&#038;utm_medium=rss&#038;utm_campaign=%25eb%258f%2599%25ed%2583%2584-%25eb%25a6%25ac%25ed%2594%2584%25ed%258c%2585-%25ea%25b3%25a0%25ec%25a3%25bc%25ed%258c%258c-vs-%25ec%25b4%2588%25ec%259d%258c%25ed%258c%258c-%25eb%2582%25b4-%25ec%2596%25bc%25ea%25b5%25b4%25ec%2597%2590-%25eb%25a7%259e%25eb%258a%2594-%25ed%2583%2580%25ec%259e%2585%25ec%259d%2580</link>
		
