		<title>리쥬란, 진짜 많이 받아 본 의사가 들려주는 이야기</title>
		<link>https://dongtan-snow.com/?p=4392&#038;utm_source=rss&#038;utm_medium=rss&#038;utm_campaign=2-%25eb%25a6%25ac%25ec%25a5%25ac%25eb%259e%2580-%25ec%25a7%2584%25ec%25a7%259c-%25eb%25a7%258e%25ec%259d%25b4-%25eb%25b0%259b%25ec%2595%2584-%25eb%25b3%25b8-%25ec%259d%2598%25ec%2582%25ac%25ea%25b0%2580-%25eb%2593%25a4%25eb%25a0%25a4%25ec%25a3%25bc%25eb%258a%2594-%25ec%259d%25b4%25ec%2595%25bc%25ea%25b8%25b0</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[스노우. 동탄]]></dc:creator>
